			"color":"#432",
			"widgets_values":[
				"English pop ballad, piano-driven, warm male vocals with soft tone, gentle strings and slow drums. Melancholic but hopeful vibe, theme about heartbreak and moving on. Cinematic build in the chorus, clean and polished production, emotional but not over-the-top. Lyrics must be in pure English, no Chinese language.\n\n节奏轻快的欧美英文流行歌曲，充满夏日活力。年轻女声主唱，音色干净明亮。搭配抓耳的钢琴分解和弦和热带House鼓点，副歌朗朗上口。整体氛围轻松治愈，主题是夏日恋爱与自由。制作现代、混音干净，无杂音，适合电台播放。\n\n\n\n\n\n"
			],
