			"color":"#432",
			"widgets_values":[
				"[Intro]\nYeah, yeah\nOh, oh\n\n[Verse 1]\nWoke up this morning with the sun in my eyes\nThe world feels brighter, like I'm finally alive\nNo more dark clouds hanging over my head\nI'm ready to run, ready to forget the past\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nThe beat drops, my heart races\nI'm stepping out of my comfort zone tonight\nNo more hiding, no more fears\nI'm gonna live like there's no tomorrow\n\n[Chorus]\nThis is my moment, my time to shine\nGonna dance like nobody's watching, gonna lose my mind\nThis is my story, my song to sing\nI'm taking back the power, letting my heart lead\nYeah, this is my moment, my time to shine\nNo more waiting, no more \"maybe next time\"\nI'm gonna rise up, touch the sky\nThis is my moment, and I'm gonna own it tonight\n\n[Verse 2]\nUsed to be scared of what the world might say\nTried to fit in, but I lost my way\nNow I'm breaking free from the chains they put on me\nLearning to love the person I was always meant to be\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nThe beat drops, my heart races\nI'm stepping out of my comfort zone tonight\nNo more hiding, no more fears\nI'm gonna live like there's no tomorrow\n\n[Chorus]\nThis is my moment, my time to shine\nGonna dance like nobody's watching, gonna lose my mind\nThis is my story, my song to sing\nI'm taking back the power, letting my heart lead\nYeah, this is my moment, my time to shine\nNo more waiting, no more \"maybe next time\"\nI'm gonna rise up, touch the sky\nThis is my moment, and I'm gonna own it tonight\n\n[Outro]\nOh, I'm gonna own it tonight\nYeah, this is my moment\nOh, yeah"
			],
